# uv Workspace Monorepo

Multi-package Python monorepo powered by [uv workspaces](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/concepts/projects/workspaces/).
One lockfile, one virtual environment, shared tooling — with libraries under
`packages/` and deployable apps under `apps/`.

> Scaffolded with [create-awesome-python-app](https://github.com/Create-Python-App/create-python-app).
> Don't use this repo as-is — generate your own and pick your options.

## Quickstart

You need [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) and Python 3.12+.

```bash
uv sync                     # install every workspace member into one .venv
uv run {{ commandName }} hello        # run the CLI app (apps/cli)
uv run pytest               # test all members
```

## What's inside

- **Workspace root** — virtual root `pyproject.toml` with `[tool.uv.workspace]`,
  a shared `dev` dependency group, and shared Ruff / Pyright / pytest config.
- **`packages/core`** — a shared library (`src/` layout) with tests.
- **`apps/cli`** — a [Typer](https://typer.tiangolo.com/) CLI that consumes
  `core` through the workspace source (`{ workspace = true }`).
- **`Makefile`** — `make sync | lint | format | typecheck | test | check | build`.

## Common tasks

| Command | Description |
| ------- | ----------- |
| `uv sync` | Install all members into a single `.venv` |
| `uv run {{ commandName }} hello [NAME]` | Run the CLI app |
| `uv run pytest` | Run the whole test suite |
| `uv run ruff check .` | Lint every member |
| `uv run ruff format .` | Format the workspace |
| `uv run pyright` | Type-check every member |
| `uv build --all-packages` | Build wheels/sdists for every member |

## Add a member

- **Library** → create `packages/<name>/` with a `pyproject.toml` and
  `src/<module>/`. It is picked up automatically by `packages/*`.
- **App** → create `apps/<name>/` the same way; it is picked up by `apps/*`.
- **Depend on a local library** → add its distribution name to the consumer's
  `dependencies` and mark it as a workspace source:

  ```toml
  [tool.uv.sources]
  "{{ packagePrefix }}-core" = { workspace = true }
  ```

